{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"OrderStepsDeliveryFaq","label":"Order steps and FAQ","description":"The steps of an order in sequence, followed by the frequently asked questions about delivery, in one section. Use it on a page about ordering, shipping or delivery when both the process and its common questions belong together.","props":"[{"name": "steps_title", "type": "text", "label": "Steps heading", "required": true, "max": 120}, {"name": "steps", "type": "items", "label": "Steps", "min": 2, "max": 8, "items": [{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Step", "required": true, "max": 80}, {"name": "text", "type": "text", "label": "What happens", "max": 300}]}, {"name": "faq_title", "type": "text", "label": "Questions heading", "required": true, "max": 120}, {"name": "questions", "type": "items", "label": "Questions", "min": 1, "max": 12, "items": [{"name": "question", "type": "text", "label": "Question", "required": true, "max": 200}, {"name": "answer", "type": "html", "label": "Answer", "required": true}]}, {"name": "single_open", "type": "boolean", "label": "Keep only one answer open at a time", "default": true}, {"name": "faq_note", "type": "html", "label": "Note under the questions", "help": "For instance, how to reach the shop for any other question."}]","sample":"{"steps_title": "Comment se passe votre commande", "steps": [{"title": "Vous commandez", "text": "Choisissez vos articles et réglez en ligne en toute sécurité."}, {"title": "Nous préparons votre colis", "text": "Votre commande est emballée avec soin sous vingt-quatre heures ouvrées."}, {"title": "Nous l’expédions", "text": "Un e-mail vous donne le numéro de suivi dès le départ du colis."}, {"title": "Vous êtes livré", "text": "Le colis arrive chez vous ou en point relais, selon votre choix."}], "faq_title": "Questions sur la livraison", "questions": [{"question": "Quels sont les délais de livraison ?", "answer": "<p>Comptez deux à trois jours ouvrés en France métropolitaine, et cinq à huit jours pour le reste de l’Europe.</p>"}, {"question": "Combien coûte la livraison ?", "answer": "<p>La livraison coûte 4,90 € en point relais et 6,90 € à domicile. Elle est offerte dès 60 € d’achat.</p>"}, {"question": "Livrez-vous à l’étranger ?", "answer": "<p>Oui, nous livrons dans toute l’Union européenne, en Suisse et au Royaume-Uni.</p>"}, {"question": "Comment suivre mon colis ?", "answer": "<p>Le lien de suivi figure dans l’e-mail d’expédition. Vous le retrouvez aussi dans votre compte client, rubrique « Mes commandes ».</p>"}, {"question": "Que faire si mon colis arrive abîmé ?", "answer": "<p>Notez une réserve auprès du livreur, puis écrivez-nous sous quarante-huit heures avec une photo du colis. Nous vous renvoyons un article neuf.</p>"}], "single_open": true, "faq_note": "<p>Une autre question ? <a href=\"/contact\">Écrivez à notre service client</a>.</p>"}","template":"<section class="order-help"><div class="order-help__part order-help__part--steps"><h2 class="order-help__title">{{ props.steps_title }}</h2><ol class="order-steps">{% for step in props.steps %}<li class="order-step"><h3 class="order-step__title">{{ step.title }}</h3>{% if step.text is not empty %}<p class="order-step__text">{{ step.text }}</p>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div><div class="order-help__part order-help__part--faq"><h2 class="order-help__title">{{ props.faq_title }}</h2><div class="faq-list">{% for item in props.questions %}{% if props.single_open %}<details class="faq-item" name="order-help-faq">{% else %}<details class="faq-item">{% endif %}<summary class="faq-item__question">{{ item.question }}</summary><div class="faq-item__answer">{{ item.answer }}</div></details>{% endfor %}</div>{% if props.faq_note is not empty %}<div class="order-help__note">{{ props.faq_note }}</div>{% endif %}</div></section>","css":".order-help { display: grid; gap: 3rem; }
.order-help__title { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.order-steps { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; counter-reset: order-step; }
.order-step { counter-increment: order-step; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); }
.order-step__title { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.125rem; }
.order-step__title::before { content: counter(order-step) ". "; color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.order-step__text { margin: 0; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.faq-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--cms-color-border); }
.faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cms-color-border); }
.faq-item__question { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cms-color-text); list-style: none; }
.faq-item__question::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.faq-item__question::after { content: "+"; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--cms-color-accent); transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
.faq-item[open] > .faq-item__question::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.faq-item__question:hover, .faq-item__question:focus-visible { color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.faq-item__question:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
.faq-item__answer { padding: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.faq-item__answer > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.faq-item__answer > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.order-help__note { margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background: var(--cms-color-accent-surface); color: var(--cms-color-text); border-radius: 0.5rem; }
.order-help__note > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.order-help__note > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.order-help__note a { color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
@media (min-width: 48rem) { .order-help { gap: 4rem; } .order-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; } .faq-item__question { padding: 1.25rem 0; } }"}
